    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/3c247acacbec4d44256a31914c50bf34.avif?t=1746748868\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be launching a crowdfunding campaign on May 14th, 6:15pm ET.  Pre-Launch page out, follow us on Kickstarter! The future of PROJECT MIX depends on the crowdfund.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.poster.avif?t=1746748868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.webm?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.mp4?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>PROJECT MIX </strong>is a VR anime narrative game.<strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the red light district of New Mong Kok, you play as Rone, a young former thug starting a new beginning to try to leave behind his life of crime. He unexpectedly becomes a bartender after a chance meeting with Valencia, the eccentric bar owner of Eleventh Heaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At first, you live by the paycheck working at Eleventh Heaven, but as you find yourself hearing a bit too much for your own good, you find yourself thrown into a deep conspiracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.poster.avif?t=1746748868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.webm?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.mp4?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique characters and learn about New Mong Kok from differing perspectives.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.poster.avif?t=1746748868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.webm?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.mp4?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shake, pour, decorate, and serve. Interactive bartending mechanics built from the ground up for VR. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you choose to serve changes the lives of your clients, and even the game narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.poster.avif?t=1746748868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.webm?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.mp4?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on the small and subtle moments, such as having a smoke after work, sharing a drink, and petting your cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world through gorgeous and atmospheric environments featuring stylized anime visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.poster.avif?t=1746748868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.webm?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.mp4?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive <strong>character moments</strong> and relationship building with detailed <strong>romance</strong> routes. Meet a variety of characters from all walks of life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack tailored especially for the game, ranging from jazz, synthpop to citypop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different play modes supported.</strong> The game can be played comfortably seated or standing, and even in your bed if you dare so.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-VR Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While our long-term vision is to build the leading VR anime/Asian game studio, we want as many people as possible to experience PROJECT MIX. If we can meet our <strong>funding stretch goals</strong>, we will definitely develop a non-VR version.<br><br>However, it won't be a basic first-person mode that any modder can throw together. Instead, it will feature <strong>completely redesigned controls</strong>, <strong>cinematic camera work</strong>, and <strong>tailored UI visuals</strong>, to more closely match what you may expect from <i>Catherine</i> or the <i>Persona</i> series. It will be a title that stands on it's own.<br><br>But it also means it will require extra time as well as skills we don't have, so the stretch goal funding will be essential.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/3c247acacbec4d44256a31914c50bf34.avif?t=1746748868\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be launching a crowdfunding campaign on May 14th, 6:15pm ET.  Pre-Launch page out, follow us on Kickstarter! The future of PROJECT MIX depends on the crowdfund.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.poster.avif?t=1746748868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.webm?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.mp4?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>PROJECT MIX </strong>is a VR anime narrative game.<strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the red light district of New Mong Kok, you play as Rone, a young former thug starting a new beginning to try to leave behind his life of crime. He unexpectedly becomes a bartender after a chance meeting with Valencia, the eccentric bar owner of Eleventh Heaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At first, you live by the paycheck working at Eleventh Heaven, but as you find yourself hearing a bit too much for your own good, you find yourself thrown into a deep conspiracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.poster.avif?t=1746748868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.webm?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.mp4?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique characters and learn about New Mong Kok from differing perspectives.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.poster.avif?t=1746748868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.webm?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.mp4?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shake, pour, decorate, and serve. Interactive bartending mechanics built from the ground up for VR. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you choose to serve changes the lives of your clients, and even the game narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.poster.avif?t=1746748868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.webm?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.mp4?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on the small and subtle moments, such as having a smoke after work, sharing a drink, and petting your cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world through gorgeous and atmospheric environments featuring stylized anime visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.poster.avif?t=1746748868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.webm?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.mp4?t=1746748868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive <strong>character moments</strong> and relationship building with detailed <strong>romance</strong> routes. Meet a variety of characters from all walks of life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack tailored especially for the game, ranging from jazz, synthpop to citypop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different play modes supported.</strong> The game can be played comfortably seated or standing, and even in your bed if you dare so.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-VR Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While our long-term vision is to build the leading VR anime/Asian game studio, we want as many people as possible to experience PROJECT MIX. If we can meet our <strong>funding stretch goals</strong>, we will definitely develop a non-VR version.<br><br>However, it won't be a basic first-person mode that any modder can throw together. Instead, it will feature <strong>completely redesigned controls</strong>, <strong>cinematic camera work</strong>, and <strong>tailored UI visuals</strong>, to more closely match what you may expect from <i>Catherine</i> or the <i>Persona</i> series. It will be a title that stands on it's own.<br><br>But it also means it will require extra time as well as skills we don't have, so the stretch goal funding will be essential.</p>",
